href="#x1-38085r21">159<!--tex4ht:ref: ex:KazPravdaInst --></t4htlink>]
      </text:p> 
</text:list-item> 

      <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="Inside-itemize" ><text:span text:style-name="textbf" ><text:span text:style-name="underline" ><text:span 
text:style-name="ecbx-1200">ProfIT.kz</text:span></text:span></text:span>  is  a  specialized  IT  market  portal.  It  has  been  operating  since  2004  with
      professional coverage for the information technology community in Kazakhstan. The outlet
      has been awarded the National Kazakhstan Internet Award &#x0022;Award.kz&#x0022; in 2007 ranked
      third  among  30  competitors  in  the  Mass  Media  category  and  in  2009  ranked  second
      among 60 competitors in Industry and Regional Portals. These awards demonstrate its
      recognition  within  the  industry  and  Kazakhstan.  The  portal  organizes  major  regional
      and international IT conferences and exhibitions, and maintains partnerships with leading
      technology companies. These factors demonstrate sustained professional standing in the IT
      focused press.
      </text:p> 
<text:p text:style-name="Inside-itemize" >This IT market feature covers Mr. Taximov’s PROFIT Contact Day 2025 presentation of
      iKOMEK 2.0. It cites operational volumes, reasons for replacing the legacy system, and goals
      of cost reduction and scalability. Features include a unified portal, a field staff application,
      an updated management panel, and an AI driven knowledge base. The article also notes
      the planned Situational Map, business intelligence tools including Power BI and Tableau,
      security testing, and integration with the e-Otinish government system.
                                                                                              
                                                                                              
      </text:p> 
<text:p text:style-name="Inside-itemize" >&#x0022;iKOMEK  2.0  a  new  generation  of  digital  response&#x0022;  <text:span text:style-name="Emphasis" ><text:span 
text:style-name="ecti-1200">PROFIT.kz</text:span></text:span>,  13  June  2025.  No
      individual author listed. URL <t4htlink 
