      <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="Inside-itemize" ><text:span text:style-name="textbf" ><text:span text:style-name="underline" ><text:span 
text:style-name="ecbx-1200">Elorda info</text:span></text:span></text:span> is a registered news outlet under Elorda Aqparat. The newspaper publishes
      daily news on capital city, national, and international developments. It has a significant
      audience  with  more  than  70  000  followers  on  its  Instagram  account.  Publications  are
      released in both Kazakh and Russian languages. This interview highlights Mr. Taximov’s
      impact on improving the iKOMEK109 center. It describes 2022 year as a transformation
      from the call-center to a unified situational center, demonstrating significant results and
      outlining Mr. Taximov’s research activities including six peer reviewed publications, Big
      Data and Geonomics research, and civic IT transformations. It also notes his participation in
      international forums, AI testing for classification and routing, and continued infrastructure
      and service upgrades.
