      media  presence  with  more  than  12000  followers  on  its  Instagram  account.  The  outlet
      publishes daily content covering domestic and international news. The article describes Mr.
      Taximov’s leadership of iKOMEK109 and its transformation. It highlights key improvements
      implemented under Mr. Taximov’s direction. The article notes his master’s degree from UCL
      funded by the Bolashak government scholarship. It also reports on his public presentations
      at major forums and his official recognition. Additionally, it mentions his earlier roles in
      innovation and strategy, his board service in state cybersecurity, and his registered software
      and peer reviewed publications.
      </text:p> 
