      <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="Inside-itemize" ><text:span text:style-name="textbf" ><text:span text:style-name="underline" ><text:span 
text:style-name="ecbx-1200">ErtenMedia kz</text:span></text:span></text:span> is  a  registered  Kazakh  language  media  portal.  The  outlet  operates  a
      multi  platform  distribution  model  with  significant  reach.  It  has  approximately  40  000
      followers  on  Instagram,  about  13000  followers  on  Telegram,  and  approximately  90  000
      followers  on  TikTok.  This  interview  outlines  Mr.  Taximov’s  leadership  of  iKOMEK109
      as a citywide digital response and analytics system. It reports significant improvements
      achieved under Mr. Taximov’s leadership. It describes the 2022 year transformation into
      a <text:span text:style-name="Emphasis" ><text:span 
text:style-name="ecti-1200">situational center</text:span></text:span> aligned with ITSM and Smart City practices. The article highlights
      Mr. Taximov’s research record including peer reviewed publications and ongoing AI testing
      for automatic classification and routing, along with continued infrastructure and service
      upgrades. Together, these publications constitute material about Mr. Taximov, naming and
      quoting him and describing his work in IT project leadership.
      </text:p> 
<text:p text:style-name="Inside-itemize" >&#x0022;iKOMEK109  15  million  plus  requests  how  the  single  contact  center  changes  the
      capital’s   life&#x0022;   <text:span text:style-name="Emphasis" ><text:span 
text:style-name="ecti-1200">ErtenMedia.kz</text:span></text:span>,   26   May   2025,   journalist:   Asylkhan   Boribai.    URL
      <t4htlink 
