<!--l. 70--><text:p text:style-name="Like-Text-body">
</text:p> 
<!--l. 73--><text:p text:style-name="Text-body">The table below compares Mr. Taximov’s documented annual earnings against independent market
benchmarks for the same occupation and geographic area.
</text:p> 
